🏦 1. Core Banking Features (Must-Have Foundation)

These are the basic but mandatory backend features:

User registration + KYC (identity verification)
Login / Logout with JWT + refresh token
Account management (savings/current accounts)
Balance inquiry
Transaction history (debit/credit ledger)
Fund transfer (within bank)
Beneficiary management
Statements (monthly PDF generation)

👉 These are expected in every banking system.

🔐 2. Advanced Security Features (VERY IMPORTANT for interviews)

This is where you stand out as a backend developer:

Authentication & Authorization
JWT + Refresh token flow
Role-based access (USER / ADMIN / BANK_MANAGER)
Device binding (login only from trusted devices)
Security layers
Multi-Factor Authentication (OTP/email/app)
Biometric login support (frontend + backend support)
Account lock after failed attempts
Session timeout handling
Fraud & risk protection
Transaction velocity check (limit per minute/hour)
Suspicious activity detection
IP/device tracking
Audit logs for every action

📌 Interview line:

“I added audit logging + risk-based checks for transaction safety.”

💸 3. Transaction System (Real Banking Logic)

This is the heart of backend system design

ACID-compliant transactions (VERY IMPORTANT)
Double-entry ledger system (debit = credit model)
Transaction status tracking (PENDING / SUCCESS / FAILED)
Rollback mechanism if failure happens
Idempotency (avoid duplicate transactions)

👉 This is what makes your project “real-world level”.

⚡ 4. Advanced Banking Features (Differentiator)

These make your project look industry-level:

Smart Banking Features
Expense categorization (food, travel, bills)
Monthly spending analytics
Savings goals system
Auto savings (round-up transactions)
Loan system
Loan application module
EMI calculator
Credit scoring logic (basic rule-based)
Notifications system
SMS/email alerts for transactions
Fraud alert notifications
Bill due reminders
📊 5. Admin & Bank Control Panel

Very important for backend projects:

User management (block/unblock users)
Transaction monitoring dashboard
